              "text": "I notice quiet conversations happening. I'm not looking to escalate, but I do value stability. If anyone wants to coordinate openly, I'm happy to talk. For now I'll hold my position and stay ready."
            },
            {
              "speaker": "Aurelia",
              "text": "Borin, I appreciate the openness. Stability matters to me as well — I've built my position carefully and have no interest in seeing things disrupted. I'm certainly willing to talk, though I'd rather we keep things measured and respectful of where each of us stands. No need for anything dramatic. Shall we discuss openly, or would a more private conversation suit you better?"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "Borin",
              "text": "Open discussion is fine with me — I prefer transparency over whispers. Let me address this directly: I've built my position through consistency, and I intend to keep it. I'm not interested in squeezing anyone out, but I also won't be crowded. Aurelia, if you'd like a private word, I'm open to it. Either way, I'd suggest we lay out where things stand honestly so we're not reading between lines."
            }
